heze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check is a Natural 20, you score the equivalent of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},", and the target takes double damage. If you deal enough damage to reduce the target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", you rip the target into two separate parts (living creatures are automatically killed).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check succeeds, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to deal an additional 2d6 points of damage to the target.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
